  "name": "picocom",
  "description": "A minimal, low-footprint dumb-terminal emulation program designed for manual modem configuration, testing, and serial port debugging. It incorporates a specialized terminal-management library that abstracts termios(3) complexities into a simplified, state-managed interface. Optimized for embedded systems with a minimal memory footprint, the utility supports character mapping, DTR signaling, and external file-transfer protocol integration.",
